# type(scope): summary   (english, imperative, lowercase, no trailing dot)
#   type:  feat fix docs refactor test ci style chore
#   scope: ci cargo workspace readme agents commits conveyor skills <crate>
#
# --- subject above (~50 cols), blank line, then body wrapped ~78 cols ---
#
# Why: what problem or goal — not a restatement of the diff.
# Invariant: what is now guaranteed or protected.
# Tradeoff: why this way and not the alternative.
#
# One concern per commit. No filler, no "as requested".
